---
/** Story: Syria — every figure is computed from the current snapshot at build time. */
import DocPage from '../DocPage.astro';
import { localizePath, type Locale } from '../../../i18n/ui';
import { getCountry, getSources } from '../../../lib/data-server';
import { fmtInt } from '../../../lib/format';
import { metricAt, peak, latestReported } from './story-utils';
interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh-Hant' || locale === 'zh-Hans';
const syr = getCountry('SYR');
const src = getSources()?.['unhcr_population'];
const n = (v: number | null | undefined) =>
  v === null || v === undefined ? '—' : fmtInt(v, locale);
const ref2010 = syr ? metricAt(syr, 'origin', 'refugees', 2010) : null;
const refPeak = syr ? peak(syr, 'origin', 'refugees') : null;
const refNow = syr ? latestReported(syr, 'origin', 'refugees') : null;
const idpPeak = syr ? peak(syr, 'asylum', 'idps') : null;
const idpNow = syr ? latestReported(syr, 'asylum', 'idps') : null;
const retNow = syr ? latestReported(syr, 'origin', 'returned_refugees') : null;
const mapLink = (q: string) => `${localizePath('/', locale)}${q}`;
---

<DocPage
  locale={locale}
  ogImage="/og/story/syria.jpg"
  title={zh ? '敘利亞：十四年的流離' : 'Syria: fourteen years displaced'}
  lede={zh
    ? '2011 年之前，敘利亞是接收難民的國家。此後十年間它是全球最大的難民來源國——而多數流離失所者，從未離開敘利亞境內。'
    : 'Before 2011, Syria was a country that hosted refugees. For a decade afterwards it was the world’s largest country of origin — and most of the displaced never left Syria at all.'}
>
  <h2>{zh ? '數字的轉折' : 'The turn in the numbers'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          2010 年年末，UNHCR 記錄的敘利亞籍難民為 <strong>{n(ref2010)}</strong> 人。到了
          {refPeak?.year} 年，這個數字達到 <strong>{n(refPeak?.value)}</strong>
          ——最新資料（{refNow?.year} 年）為 <strong>{n(refNow?.value)}</strong> 人。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          At the end of 2010, UNHCR recorded <strong>{n(ref2010)}</strong> Syrian refugees. By{' '}
          {refPeak?.year} the figure reached <strong>{n(refPeak?.value)}</strong> — the latest
          figure ({refNow?.year}) is <strong>{n(refNow?.value)}</strong>.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href={mapLink(`?m=refugees&v=origin&c=SYR&y=${refNow?.year ?? 2024}`)}
      >{zh ? '在地圖上檢視 →' : 'See it on the map →'}</a
    >
  </p>

  <h2>{zh ? '多數人沒有跨過國界' : 'Most never crossed a border'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          境內流離失所者（IDP）在 {idpPeak?.year} 年達到高峰：<strong>{n(idpPeak?.value)}</strong>
          人——高於任何單一國家收容的敘利亞難民數。最新資料（{idpNow?.year} 年）為{' '}
          <strong>{n(idpNow?.value)}</strong>{' '}
          人。境內流離失所沒有「收容國」：這些人算在敘利亞自己名下，在兩種視角中都一樣。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          Internal displacement peaked in {idpPeak?.year} at <strong>{n(idpPeak?.value)}</strong>{' '}
          people — more than any single country hosted in Syrian refugees. The latest figure (
          {idpNow?.year}) is <strong>{n(idpNow?.value)}</strong>. Internal displacement has no "host
          country": these people are counted under Syria itself, in both views.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href={mapLink(`?m=idps&v=origin&c=SYR&y=${idpPeak?.year ?? 2016}`)}
      >{zh ? `在地圖上檢視 ${idpPeak?.year} 年 →` : `See ${idpPeak?.year} on the map →`}</a
    >
  </p>

  <h2>{zh ? '回返，緩慢地' : 'Returns, slowly'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          {retNow?.year} 年，有 <strong>{n(retNow?.value)}</strong>
          名難民回到敘利亞（年度流量，非存量）。回返是自願、安全與尊嚴的問題——數字只記錄發生了多少，不評斷該不該發生。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          In {retNow?.year}, <strong>{n(retNow?.value)}</strong> refugees returned to Syria (a flow
          during the year, not a stock). Return is a question of voluntariness, safety and dignity —
          the number records how many happened, not whether they should have.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>

  <h2>{zh ? '這些數字從哪裡來' : 'Where these numbers come from'}</h2>
  <p class="small muted">
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          本頁每個數字都在建置時由本站發布的資料計算而得（來源：{src?.attribution ?? 'UNHCR'}
          ，資料截至 {src?.data_as_of ?? '—'}
          ），不由編輯手寫，會隨每次資料更新自動修正。定義與注意事項見
          <a href={localizePath('/methodology', locale)}>方法論</a>；完整序列見
          <a href={localizePath('/country/SYR', locale)}>敘利亞國家頁</a>。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          Every figure on this page is computed at build time from the data this site publishes
          (source: {src?.attribution ?? 'UNHCR'}, data as of {src?.data_as_of ?? '—'}) — never
          hand-written, and corrected automatically with every data update. Definitions and caveats:{' '}
          <a href={localizePath('/methodology', locale)}>methodology</a>; the full series:{' '}
          <a href={localizePath('/country/SYR', locale)}>the Syria country page</a>.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>
</DocPage>
